DURROKI AZIYAT HAI NA ZINDAAN E JAFA HAI, <br>
ZAINAB HAI MADINA HAI GHAM-E-KARBO BALA HAI<br>
<br>
 PHIR JATA HAIN ANKHON MEIN WO ASHOOR KA MANZAR,<br>
 MAQTAL KI FIZAAON MEIN WO AZAAN-E-ALI AKBAR,<br>
 WO NUSRATE SHABBIR MEIN ANSAR KE TEWAR,<br>
 DO LAAKH KE NARGHE MEIN WO AULAADE PAIYAMBAR<br>
<br>
WO MAQTAL-E-KHONEBARAR WO DARIYA KI RAWANI,<br>
 TEERO KI WO BARISH MEIN WO TASHNA DAHANI,<br>
 GHERE HUE SAHIL KO KAYI ZULM KE BAANI,<br>
 BESHEER KE HOTHOU KO TARASTA HUA PAANI<br>
<br>
SAB QATL HUE LOOT GAYA ZEHRA KA BHARA GHAR,<br>
 WO NAHER PA SOYA HUA ABBAS-E-DILAWAR,<br>
WO KHOON MEIN DOOBI HUI TASWEER-E-PAIYAMBAR,<br>
 WO HALQPA SARWAR KE RAWAN SHUMR KA KHANJAR<br>
<br>
KEHTI HAIN KABHI AYE MERE AAGOSH KE PAALE,<br>
 KYA BAAT HUI KIS LIYE AMMA SE KHAFA HO,<br>
 KHUD AA NAHI SAKTE HO TO AWAAZ SUNAYO,<br>
 AYE OUN-O-MOHAMMAD MUJHE MAA KEHKE PUKARO<br>
<br>
WO SHAAME GAREEBA WO LAYEENO KE IRAADE,<br>
 WO SABR KE KHAEMO MEIN QADAM FOUJ-E-SITAM KE,<br>
 WO MAAYOON KI AAGOSH MEIN SEHME HUE BACCHE,<br>
 JALTE HUE KHAIME WO BHADAKTE HUE SHOLE<br>
<br>
KOOFE MEIN NABI ZADIYOON BE MAQNAO CHADAR,<br>
 WO SHAAM KA DAR BAR WO AULAADE PAIYAMBAR,<br>
 MOHTAJ &ndash;E-RIDA HYDER-E-KARRAR KI DUKHTAR,<br>
 ZALIM NE RAKHA TAQT KE NICHE SARE SARWAR<br>
<br>
WO SHAAM KE ZINDAAN WO SEHMI HUI RAATEIN,<br>
 MAAHOL PURUSHUB MEIN GUZARI HUI RAATIN,<br>
 HALAAT KE EK MOUT PA THARI HUI RAATEIN,<br>
 YAAD AATI HAI REH REH KE WO TAPTI HUI RAATEIN<br>
<br>
KYA KHOOB ZAHEER AAPNE LIKHA HAI YE NOUHA,<br>
 TASKEEN-E-DIL-E-FATIMA ZEHRA HAI YE NOUHA,<br>
 KULSOOM KI ZAINAB KI TAMANNA HAI YE NOUHA,<br>
 BAQSHISH KA SARE HASHR SAHARA HAI YE NOUHA..